sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Human reviewer
    participant A as Bob / MCP client
    participant C as Camel tool and routes
    participant K as Kafka
    participant D as JDBC audit and reviews
    H->>A: Confirm outcome, reviewer ID, and reason
    A->>C: submit_human_decision, confirmed=true
    C->>K: Human decision command
    K-->>C: Publication acknowledged
    C-->>A: SUBMITTED and decisionId
    K->>C: Deliver command to worker group
    C->>D: Validate, reserve review, and record decision
    C->>K: HUMAN_DECISION final event
    K-->>C: Publication acknowledged
    C->>D: Mark PUBLISHED and close review
    C->>K: Commit command offset
    A->>C: get_human_decision
    C-->>A: Audit details and PUBLISHED status
